---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Privacy" top={null} description="What is published here, what never is, and how a private record becomes public content.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
      <p class="label">Privacy</p>
      <h1 style="font-size:40px">Only deliberately published figures appear here.</h1>
      <p class="dek" style="font-size:19px">
        Journals, photos, medical records, genome identifiers and age stay private. A private record reaches a public page only through the platform's
        publication boundary and, where a person's words or a picture are concerned, an explicit approval. Readers' entries are never collected on these
        pages.
      </p>
      <p>The full policy and the AI disclaimer are on the current site: <a href="https://averagejoematt.com/privacy/">averagejoematt.com/privacy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
